B.asY=new A.iT("570","Birth in Makkah","Muhammad \ufdfa was born in the Year of the Elephant, in the clan of Banu Hashim. His father Abdullah had already died.")
B.asZ=new A.iT("575","In the care of Halimah","He was nursed in the desert among Banu Sa'd, then returned to his mother Aminah.")
B.at1=new A.iT("576\u2013578","Orphaned","His mother died on the return from Madinah, and his grandfather Abdul Muttalib cared for him, then his uncle Abu Talib.")
B.at0=new A.iT("595","Marriage to Khadijah","He married Khadijah bint Khuwaylid, who was the first to believe in his message.")
B.asU=new A.iT("610","First revelation",'In the cave of Hira, in Ramadan, Jibril brought the first verses of Surah Al-Alaq: "Read in the name of your Lord." He was forty years old.')
B.at2=new A.iT("613","Open call","After a private call, he was commanded to warn his closest kin and then to proclaim the message in public.")
B.asT=new A.iT("619","The Year of Sorrow","Khadijah and Abu Talib both died. The hardship in Makkah grew heavier.")
B.at3=new A.iT("620","Isra and Mi'raj","He was taken by night from Masjid al-Haram to Masjid al-Aqsa, then ascended, and the five daily prayers were made obligatory.")
B.asX=new A.iT("622","The Hijrah","He and Abu Bakr left Makkah and reached Madinah. This migration begins the Islamic calendar.")
B.asV=new A.iT("624","Badr","The Muslims, few in number, met the Quraysh at Badr and Allah granted them victory.")
B.asW=new A.iT("628","Hudaybiyyah","A treaty was made with Quraysh. The Quran called it a clear victory, and it opened the way to a wider call.")
B.at_=new A.iT("630","Conquest of Makkah","The Prophet \ufdfa entered Makkah, the idols were removed from the Kaaba, and he forgave its people.")
B.asS=new A.iT("632","Farewell and return","He performed the Farewell Hajj, delivered the sermon at Arafah, and died later that year in Madinah. He was buried in the room of Aisha.")
